# `agents.templates`

Starter templates for the agent-create wizard.

**Policy** — read (C0, safe). Capability `ship.agents.read`.

## Arguments

None.

## Returns

`AgentTemplatesResponse` (JSON).

| field | type |
|-------|------|
| `items` | `map` |

## Invoke

```
ship ops call agents.templates --json '{}'
```

Kind: read.

